fonts-jetbrains-mono-minimal (2.304+ds-5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Use Debhelper 11 and the stock Ubuntu Bionic toolchain.
  * Package unchanged static TTFs from Debian 13 fonts-jetbrains-mono
    2.304+ds-5 in a checksum-verified desktop source component.
  * Retain original source, copyright and build-time font checks without
    requiring newer fontmake or gftools in Bionic.
  * Ship four static styles with complete character coverage; omit additional
    weights, the NL family and web fonts.
  * Verify real styles, multilingual coverage and fixed-width metrics.

